Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.06,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of form we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you\Nas you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do that wind to dry all the tears as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you're blaving the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure,\Nfound in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The government knows me as the\Npirate who hates other pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,An accurate assessment!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Excluding your people!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You hate pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be a shock coming from me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to visit Whitebeard's\Nship on a regular basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but because of my status\Nwith the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd travel underwater to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, he and his crew\Nwere good friends to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I recall you almost\Nkilled me one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I can say the\Nsame thing about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But all that aside, I owe\NWhitebeard a great debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.58,0:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island is now a\Npeaceful haven once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's all thanks to\Nthat old man of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know pirates sailing along\Nthe Grand Line must pass through
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island to reach the New World\Nso not long after the dawn of the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,great pirate era the island was in\Ntrouble numerous human pirates and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,navy ships that were chasing after\NWhitebeard arrived there wreaking havoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless fishmen and mermaids\Nwere kidnapped and sold as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And just when despair threatened\Nto conquer our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard showed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From this point forward I claim\Nthis island as my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A simple proclamation A\Nprecious few words ensured
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that no one would lay a finger\Non Fishman Island again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The power that Whitebeard\Ncommands is that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I live, I will\Nnever forget that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just my homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He protects other islands\Nin much the same manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The government targets him because he is a\Npirate, but they refuse to see the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I object.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If he happened to die, what\Nwould become of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would dare to welcome the chaos\Nthat would reign in his absence?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who but a fool would dare\Nto usher in such madness?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stop this war even\Nif I must give up my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to rescue you, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I haven't given up hope yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that a miracle\Nand our chance may come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My my,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,sounds like there's a lot of\Nfun going on in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,opportunity to defeat. Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even locked down here, I can't\Nhelp but feel a bit excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you think you\Ncan take the old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,About time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna be the one to\Nkill him! Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna take a crack at him too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put an end to his era.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools! Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, Ace, look, do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This world is full of\Ndozens of second-placers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,silver medalists who could never\Ndefeat Roger and Whitebeard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,all holding back their tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder we lost\Ncommunication with Level 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those prisoners knocked a\Nbasilisk right into the comm room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two were able to beat a basilisk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are they anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You do? Really? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But now it seems there are three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:06:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The big centipede just exploded\Ninto a bunch of little ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What centipede?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.49,0:07:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a bunch of poisonous scorpions\Nstacked on top of one another!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there are more things chasing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm the best while those dumb\Nanimals are following my footsteps we're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,free to make our
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Break damn
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,these things
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,by the way I heard the boss of beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,on level two looks like some sort Of lion\Nare all of these things bosses of course
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:08:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,they're not bosses these are clearly\Nmanticores Can't you see their human faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they catch us, they'll\Nchew until only bones remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the key in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the key. Ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they have human faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,they can imitate different people\Nthey've heard around the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just repeating things they've\Nheard some of the prisoners say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They have no idea what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This sure is creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Loin cloth. Loin cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawberry panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell have they been\Nlistening to around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Beefsteak, beefsteak, beefsteak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Beefsteak?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, listen to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you were going to help\Nus get through this place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did, and I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We should join forces and break\Nout of this prison together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I don't want to break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know how to\Nget down to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you don't\Nunderstand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, it only gets\Nworse the deeper you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the scoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.91,0:08:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat broke into the prison\Nto rescue his brother Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously telling me\NFirefist Ace is Straw Hat's brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And you broke into Impel\NDown to rescue him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone like Firefist\NAce is being held here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,then he would be all the\Nway down in level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Call me out. That's madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that you don't want to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the stairs, you imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairs are all connected\Nfrom level one to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use Straw Hat\Nas bait for the beast
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,guarding the stairs if it makes my escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's ingenious, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll stay. Let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this way, Abe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, you ran into something big!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the guardian of the stairs\Nto help each notice the sinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a lion or a grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay! I'm close!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover it back to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Noodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Noodle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pork Noodle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chinese Noodle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Were the prisoners really\Ntalking about noodles that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegetable Noodle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be the space and\Nhe's going crazy about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be stuck\Nin this place forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His strong end making me hungry. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in going down\Nto the lower levels of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right there with you on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what do you say we form an\Nalliance and break out of this dump?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so pleased to hear\Nthat you're a real escapee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that that's settled, let's\Nbegin the Straw Hat for dinner plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you two doing? Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fartouca!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it a good idea to piss him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I go to a\Nhigher safer place, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.16,0:12:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Corn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, corn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I tricked you, you ghastly abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What you smashed was just a wax figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I created with my wax wax power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huxing noodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I admit they look much more\Nconvincing With Miss Goldenwing's coloring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was still enough to trick\NA foolish beast such as yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is the real me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Noodle Missed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.94,0:12:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Noodle Missed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Wrong. Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.41,0:12:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him! No, no. Not even close. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even try. Missed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bad at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Try there! No, no. Missed again.\NNo, no. Yeah! Get him! No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's playing with him. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're a risk-taker, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're gonna laugh\Nyourself into an early grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're starting\Nto get the hang of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the simpletons have their fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance to make a break for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that rumbling\Nand shaking all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, those three guys must\Nreally be pissing off the Sphinx.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 3 to monitoring room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 3 to monitoring room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're hearing a lot of\Nnoise from upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,3, it's time to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The perfect escape plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This wasn't our plan, we're just running\NWorks either way, I guess Hey, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the door that needs the\Nstairs. I'll make a key out of wax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the monitoring room Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we still can't get in\Ntouch with level 2 so
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,we have no idea what's\Ngoing on down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, you stupid beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've cracked the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're all gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is level three!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the ceiling is giving way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sphinx is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're falling to level three!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Noodle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mara da room, we've arrived at level two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see the image on screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep us posted on what\Nyou find down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the size of this hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:15:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so big even the sphinx\Ncould have fallen through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell is Straw\NHat Luffy looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That does not look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how they got the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But the prisoners on level\Ntwo are out of their cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me Straw Hat\Nand his friends did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guards are in trouble down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for our\Nsavior, Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's payback time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Level two reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We need backup here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoners are all free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, the prisoners are all free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, let's go to level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, good news, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We know what Straw Hat's doing. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Fleet Admiral Sengoku\Nhimself just sent word to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Little did we know, Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and our condemned\Nprisoner Port Gosti Ace
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,have more in common than\Nthe D in their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out they're brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying he's trying\Nto stop the public execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Break in and make it out with his\Nbrother before we can transport him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That would explain why\Nhe keeps going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so focused on Whitebeard's\Nattack, we let him sneak inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If he manages to pull this off,\Nall hell's gonna break loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Inform Warden Magellan immediately and get\Nthat riot on level two under control. Now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,think
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at a crossroads that could\Nchange the future of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet that troublemaking grandson of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,seems to undermine our\Nefforts at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like it Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.34,0:17:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unprecedented, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let this sink in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't had a single breakout\Nin Impel Down in the past 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Golden Lion was the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else has challenged these\Nwalls from the inside or the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Impel Down is more than a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a symbol of unyielding\Njustice with an iron-tight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,reputation that Straw Hat\Nis attempting to tarnish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And to make it even worse,\Nhe's the grandson of a marine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, I'm so proud of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, damn that Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he took care of the Straw\NHat crew at the Sabaody Archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:18:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known better\Nthan to trust that fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Man's one of the seven\Nwarlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is how he was able to\Nget through the defenses we've got set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you flew here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you weren't known all over the\NGrand Line as the hero of the Navy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doc, I'd make you take responsibility\Nfor your family myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Lock me up. Execute me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it up while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But a blow like this to our reputation\Nwill have serious repercussions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,City and I have tried to keep this under\Nwraps, but there's only so much we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.38,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, those are mine, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair. Get up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This floor feels like a frying pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we in the desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I never wanted to end up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have to go to one more crappy\Nplace with you, I'll lose my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking a cat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's real funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is especially\Nbad for someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a wax man, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right, then off we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey look it's grilled\Nchicken time that is not
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,natural a hummingbird\Nfluttered down from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was grilled in the\Nopen how hot is it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey could you tell me where the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A miserable sight if\NI've ever seen one. You
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't think looking at\Nthem now but the Prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,on this floor were all hardened criminals
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,commanding bounties of\Nover 50 million berries
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath here is the burning heat hell\Ncooking the ground also these men are
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,deprived of food And water leaving them\Nhalf dead a shell of their former selves
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Level Three, the starvation hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes now you know why this floor is\Ncovered with what appears to be sand
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas yes chances are what\Nyou're standing on are
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the remains of prisoners\Nwho have Completely dried
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,up if we remain in this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,place too long we'll become
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sand beneath someone's\Nfeet, just like they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words let's move while we have
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.82,0:21:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the sweat to spare okay then let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.66,0:21:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,To level four already seriously not that\Nway we need to take the stairs to the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,left. We do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we should take the pass on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you making this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we back
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,where we started?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope we get to level four soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.42,0:21:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said we were going\Nto say these together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to show me the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.56,0:21:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of us did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just making stuff up because\Nthat's what you want to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sworn you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They've returned and are in place, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.51,0:21:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then draw the net. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I don't need...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing? A trap? Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.30,0:22:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's made of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.16,0:22:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be able to use\Nmy chop-chop powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.62,0:22:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be lined with sea prism stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear they'll give us more than a slap on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the wrist for our little attempted escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be tortured to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We've captured the invader straw\Nhat Luffy, along with two others.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.26,0:22:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, two others?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.46,0:22:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.58,0:22:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't antagonize them, buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's more than bad\Nenough already. WRAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be some way to rip this net!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The guards and the Bligori are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.42,0:22:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the Sea Prism Stone handcuffs on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.90,0:23:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is called Solbreath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Solbreath, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.28,0:23:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You better change your diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I said.\NPay attention. It's saw death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.18,0:23:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it right
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardine head no get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.66,0:23:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in you resisting\Nus you're in a highly secure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,underwater prison so needless to\Nsay there's nowhere for you to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you're fortunate that I\Nwas the one who captured you there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,are four other guards prowling\Naround on the floors beyond this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.68,0:23:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.59,0:24:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This little guy's downright cute\Ncompared to what's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief, the Sphinx!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.48,0:24:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's moved on to busters now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.22,0:24:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna break the net!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.80,0:24:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't escape,\Nespecially not Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.06,0:24:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say that one yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.50,0:24:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even care anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.64,0:24:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.56,0:24:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still hot, but at\Nleast they can run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,After them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.34,0:24:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sackler!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.30,0:25:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.32,0:25:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.52,0:25:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Three! Hurry up. I can't\Nmove quickly in this heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.26,0:25:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They climbed up the net, good thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.16,0:25:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your brother I said hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.10,0:25:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's still alive, I'll buy him a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.12,0:25:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, thanks for being\Nour live bait, you little imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.72,0:25:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to see they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.16,0:25:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, okay. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot for your help, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.58,0:25:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.06,0:25:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart, it's breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.22,0:25:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.36,0:25:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a 300 million berry bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.14,0:25:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance. Run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.30,0:25:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.24,0:25:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't have time to\Nfight all you guys right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.16,0:25:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.18,0:25:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.08,0:25:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on a rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.26,0:26:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on the run! After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairs to go down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.80,0:26:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Too hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.94,0:26:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're safe up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.02,0:26:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Their attention's on\NStraw Hat like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.76,0:26:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They've sealed off the\Nstaircases leading up,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.28,0:26:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's getting far too hot for\Nme to remain here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.06,0:26:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's that singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.82,0:27:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They always say it's all\Nabout the ways of boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.06,0:27:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and girls but I'm special\Ncause I take the best
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.76,0:27:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,from both worlds that's\Nwhy we are always free
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.74,0:27:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,always free when you're
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.72,0:27:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Queer you never fear. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.58,0:27:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,never fear Oh, come my way
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come my way
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.94,0:27:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,boys Spin and spin like you're caught\Nup at the time of the times Hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.04,0:27:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,this way Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.98,0:27:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,listen I don't think we should
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.44,0:27:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.76,0:27:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,lazybones The party's just getting started\NIf you think it's steamy in here now,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll really hate it when I'm angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.54,0:28:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.92,0:28:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the... Mr. Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.24,0:28:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.94,0:28:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in Impel Down?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're behind bars, so you\Nmust have been caught, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.66,0:28:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.96,0:28:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's behind bars, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.64,0:28:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you like my\None-of-a-kind double take?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.12,0:28:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Kenpo special technique called\Nlooking back on that autumn night's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.30,0:28:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell is\Nthis strange creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.82,0:28:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.86,0:28:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be sure to not let it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.18,0:28:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.00,0:28:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got way too much energy\Nto stay cooped up in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:28:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Our security here is legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.22,0:29:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he able to slip through?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.20,0:29:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And though he's just one invader,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.16,0:29:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,if we let him rescue Ace,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.90,0:29:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,not only will it be the ultimate\Nhumiliation for Impel Down,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.38,0:29:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but for the entire world government!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.22,0:29:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.44,0:29:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of Navy Headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.44,0:29:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna head into\Nthat prison and stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.26,0:29:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.84,0:29:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a moment. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.82,0:29:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mistress Sadie, our torture expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.96,0:29:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already been compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.60,0:29:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so accepting the help of the\NNavy would just further disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.68,0:29:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, the good name of Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.56,0:29:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistress, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What, does she think she's\Nbeing cute or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.98,0:29:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.48,0:29:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You will refer to me as Mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those screams are irresistible!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.04,0:30:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you... Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.98,0:30:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you don't\Nneed the Navy's aid? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.70,0:30:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole prison is a labyrinthine hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't know your way around\Nin here, you'll be of no help to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.36,0:30:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That being said, if you wish to\Nserve us, you can guard the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.60,0:30:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This drawbridge is the only entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.54,0:30:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll secure ourselves inside, raise\Nit, and seal off Impel Down completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.16,0:30:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as you do yours, nobody\Nwill escape from this prison alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.00,0:30:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.98,0:30:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll remain here and guard the gate then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.96,0:30:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There, that's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.02,0:30:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.76,0:30:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.84,0:30:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Koala?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.06,0:30:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A koala?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.12,0:31:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.52,0:31:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Impel Down Impel Down is\Nnow completely sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.60,0:31:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And your boo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and Magellan's here,\Ntoo. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a special visitor, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.10,0:31:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Behave yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.38,0:31:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never guess who it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.12,0:31:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimbei
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.38,0:31:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know her well, but\Neven you've never met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.88,0:31:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should give Ace here a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.88,0:31:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is notorious, but\Nshe never shows herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.14,0:31:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She leads a tribe of\Nwarriors called the Kuja.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.44,0:32:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's one of the\Nseven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.12,0:32:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong, noble, and the most\Nbeautiful woman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.60,0:32:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate empress, Boa Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.87,0:32:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Check her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.86,0:32:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.70,0:32:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When I become warden, will you do me\Nthe honor of being my beautiful bride?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.02,0:32:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Marry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.50,0:32:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.41,0:32:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm warden, I'll\Nhit on her all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.38,0:32:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, sorry, warden, you\Ncan hit me all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.06,0:32:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough of your tomfoolery. Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.60,0:32:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.70,0:32:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, am I seeing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.36,0:32:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.44,0:32:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So she's the snake princess of Kuja.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.76,0:32:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, move a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.66,0:32:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around, Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.90,0:32:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that is some choice meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.44,0:32:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hot stuff, come to our cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.24,0:32:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give you some 10-11\Nlike you've never had before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.74,0:32:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she smells amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.42,0:32:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I ever get out of here, I'm\Ngoing straight to Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.48,0:33:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it's full of hot, naked chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.40,0:33:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.52,0:33:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.56,0:33:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.24,0:33:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.54,0:33:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply wanted to take\Na good look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.58,0:33:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To see the cause of the war, I will\Ntake part in firsthand. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.42,0:33:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I everything you'd hoped for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.04,0:33:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore us like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.14,0:33:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here and give me some!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.66,0:33:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.90,0:33:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you've always been the Empress who stood\Nher ground and disobeyed every summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.46,0:33:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you're going to take part in this war?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope your title is worth your dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.62,0:33:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A pleasure to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.38,0:33:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now mind your foolish tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.66,0:33:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I want to lick her everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.52,0:33:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down, damned louse!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.26,0:33:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it, Magellan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.56,0:33:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say diarrhea man?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.44,0:33:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.64,0:33:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Snake Princess, I bet the women on\Nyour island are hungry for guys like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.14,0:33:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.05,0:34:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you make Hannibal\Nthe warden? Really now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.60,0:34:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hancock, move that sexy\Nass over to our cell already!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.70,0:34:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep accosting me\Nwith those coarse voices...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.74,0:34:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.54,0:34:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.30,0:34:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so cute. She's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.54,0:34:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us have her, Diarrhea Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.68,0:34:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's a more vile place in\Nthis world, I don't want to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.40,0:34:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.10,0:34:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's calling you Diarrhea\NMan, and you just put up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.80,0:34:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's disgraceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.00,0:34:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's your attitude, I know a\Nguy who'd love to have your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.42,0:34:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.10,0:34:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Diarrhea Man for shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.12,0:34:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.14,0:34:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.32,0:34:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me have her for myself, diarrhea man!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.20,0:34:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Diarrhea man!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.20,0:34:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show her my snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.46,0:34:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tolerate your\Nimpertinence any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.98,0:34:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.62,0:34:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:34:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One Magellan!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.45,0:35:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.44,0:35:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna kill us, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.74,0:35:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to suffer. No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.72,0:35:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.56,0:35:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You degenerate seem to\Nhave forgotten your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.52,0:35:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you who\Nthe boss is around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.76,0:35:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.36,0:35:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Magellan! Stop! Please! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.10,0:35:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just joking around! Honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.92,0:35:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.83,0:36:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.75,0:36:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.26,0:36:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dead man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.26,0:36:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.20,0:36:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the antidote! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.46,0:36:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Never forget that I have\Nnot only the authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.44,0:36:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but also the ability to execute\Nany one of you at my whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.96,0:36:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.90,0:36:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.52,0:36:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free to speak with him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.26,0:36:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed I'm finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait is what you just told me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.08,0:36:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What reason would I have to lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.98,0:36:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, he was afraid you might\Nbe angry, but he still had to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.82,0:36:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really all you needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.52,0:36:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think they were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.68,0:36:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.26,0:37:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was busy\Ntrying to get away from you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.24,0:37:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So ace, will you tell\Nme what she said to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.52,0:37:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that my brother\Nis here. You mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.42,0:37:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,luffy the one with the\NStraw Hat that you're
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.62,0:37:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,always talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.53,0:37:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,that fool oh
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.36,0:37:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,man when the
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.90,0:37:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,heck did i start going\Nupstairs i want to go
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.02,0:37:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,downstairs well if it\Nstarted going up it'll
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.78,0:37:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,probably go back down\Nagain sooner or later
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm getting hungry i've\Ngot an image of him
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.92,0:37:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and it appears he's\Nabout to enter district c
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.16,0:37:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're using sea prism stone nuts again!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.78,0:37:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.28,0:38:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's that lion thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.40,0:38:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.82,0:38:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.62,0:38:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a hand, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.20,0:38:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.18,0:38:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Fooled ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.62,0:38:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Swan Parabas!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.42,0:38:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not Zoro, but\Nhe does sound familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.20,0:38:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Been a while, straw boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.04,0:38:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you miss me, old pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.36,0:39:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's about to be turned up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.84,0:39:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.86,0:39:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd still rather have Zoro, but I'm glad\Nyou're alive after all that happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.16,0:39:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dock. Open fire on Straw Hat! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.88,0:39:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards, you stay away from my friend,\NI think you're about to get fed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.58,0:39:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy, Sphinx.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.04,0:39:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.00,0:39:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.91,0:39:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,After a beating like that, he\Nshouldn't be bothering us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.22,0:39:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes when you're\Ndealing with an animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.14,0:39:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to teach it\Nthe law of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.18,0:39:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fried noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.90,0:39:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You really bailed us out last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.00,0:39:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but I thought for sure you were\Ndead if I ever happened to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.08,0:40:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop pulling my tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.24,0:40:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know swans never die!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.56,0:40:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless that isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.28,0:40:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And now a reminder of how\NBon Clay's power works.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.42,0:40:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate the clone clone fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.18,0:40:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing him to transform into anyone whose\Nface he's touched with his right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.40,0:40:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He was able to turn into Zoro\Nbecause he had touched him before,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.72,0:40:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but he is not able to mimic his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.90,0:40:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's another escapee to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.64,0:40:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The deeper the Straw Hat descends, the\Nmore frenzy seems to pick up along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.94,0:40:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lugari, I don't care what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.06,0:40:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.98,0:40:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, I heard that you wanted\Nto go all the way down to level five?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.76,0:41:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the plan, but I can use\Na guide if you're not too busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.88,0:41:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't have it any other way, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.94,0:41:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As fate would have it, there's someone\Ndown on level five I'd like to see, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.90,0:41:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.94,0:41:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.82,0:41:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
